#DESCRIPTION
Anisotropic electron pressure (CGL): whistler/mirror marginal-stability limiter.
Uniform magnetized heavy-ion plasma initialized beyond the electron whistler
threshold (Te,perp / Te,par = 10.0) with usePeInstabilityLimit = T and
peAnisoRelaxTimeSI = 0.0. Checks exact Pe conservation and Newton-bisection
clamping of PePerp/PePar - 1 to peWhistlerCoef / beta_e,par^peWhistlerExp.

#INITFROMSWMF
F                       initFromSWMF

#GEOMETRY
-8.0                    xMin
 8.0                    xMax
-0.05                   yMin
 0.05                   yMax
-0.05                   zMin
 0.05                   zMax

#NCELL
